    "commit": "edf6bd10389aa0c17198bf0b02e40e67b58bd5f7",
    "commit_body": "When trend+BB+MACD+Stoch+TA collectively score < 40, oversold RSI contradicts\nthe put thesis (component scores it HIGH as bounce zone, fighting the downtrend).\nNeutralize RSI to 50 in that regime.\n\nAblation-validated on full universe (596 stocks, 365d):\n  put <15 WR: 68.8% \u2192 75.0% (+6.2pp)\n  put <5  WR: 62.9% \u2192 88.9% (+26pp)\n  call 75+ WR: 74.9% \u2192 77.4% (+2.5pp)\n  call 90+ WR: 78.6% \u2192 76.3% (-2.3pp, accepted tradeoff)\n\nAlso: fix Unicode \u2192 in assess_scores print_diff_assessment (Windows cp1252),\nadd ablation + RSI asymmetry variants to experiments/score_variants.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
